<title>USA: Lasermedics to acquire Med-Quip.</title>
<headline>Lasermedics to acquire Med-Quip.</headline>
<dateline>SUGAR LAND, Texas 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lasermedics Inc said Monday it acquired all of the outstanding capital stock of Med-Quip Inc in exchange for common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the acquisition of Med-Quip, a specialty distributor of electrophysiotherapy, physical therapy, rehabilitation and chiropractic equipment, is expected to boost earnings and add about $3.9 million to its revenue in 1997.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
